{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22231","headline":"望江楼上作 · 白居易","name":"望江楼上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江畔百尺楼，楼前千里道。\n凭高望平远，亦足舒怀抱。\n驿路使憧憧，关防兵草草。\n及兹多事日，尤觉闲人好。\n我年过不惑，休退诚非早。\n从此拂尘衣，归山未爲老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}